# Cursor Project Rules for Threadr
Refer to AGENTS.md in the repository root for full codebase rules and architecture.

- Always explain terminal commands before proposing them.
- Do not perform git commits or pushes automatically.
- Keep TypeScript strictly typed (no `any` without justification).
- Run lint and test suites before concluding tasks:
  - Backend: `npm --prefix backend run lint && npm --prefix backend test`
  - Frontend: `npm --prefix frontend run lint && npm --prefix frontend test`
  - Build: `npm --prefix frontend run build`
